    "detailed_description": "So what is Eugene's dream? A brand new cleaning product? A type of pink car dice perhaps? No, you idiot. It's a new video game featuring everyone's  favourite tie wearing robot with a boring 9 to 5 job; Eugene. Eugene is just your average cleaning robot on a spaceship, but that's all about to change when a workplace accident causes him to be sucked out of an airlock. Thrown into a world of madness, Eugene will do whatever it takes to make it back home...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of Eugene as he tries to navigate this insane world, which way will lead him home safely and which way will lead to a DEAD end? With Branching paths and many situations to play through getting home safe is harder than it might seem<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's wacky fun designed to annoy the player and prevent them from reaching their goal of getting our hero back home! This game benefits from re-playing with different choices.",
    "about_the_game": "So what is Eugene's dream? A brand new cleaning product? A type of pink car dice perhaps? No, you idiot. It's a new video game featuring everyone's  favourite tie wearing robot with a boring 9 to 5 job; Eugene. Eugene is just your average cleaning robot on a spaceship, but that's all about to change when a workplace accident causes him to be sucked out of an airlock. Thrown into a world of madness, Eugene will do whatever it takes to make it back home...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of Eugene as he tries to navigate this insane world, which way will lead him home safely and which way will lead to a DEAD end? With Branching paths and many situations to play through getting home safe is harder than it might seem<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's wacky fun designed to annoy the player and prevent them from reaching their goal of getting our hero back home! This game benefits from re-playing with different choices.",
    "short_description": "Surreal and Weird, a game designed to hate the player. Featuring branch paths and plenty of funny events to playthrough such as platforming, shooting, bowling, horror, driving, mystery solving and more",
